shortdesc Dvipdfmx extras for use with beamer
relocated 1
longdesc The package is a driver to support beamer Navigation symbols
longdesc and \framezoomed regions when using dvipdfmx as PDF generator
longdesc (e.g., as part of e-pTeX). The package does not define any
longdesc 'user' commands.
